  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Recall the relationship between the present amount of element and the initial amount of element in terms of the decay constant,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math>, now the relation between decay constant and half-life,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mfrac><msub><mrow/><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msub></mfrac></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></math>.</p>"
